---
description: Playwright and in-game E2E hooks
globs:
  - e2e/**/*.ts
  - src/e2e/**/*.ts
  - playwright.config.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

- Hooks are on only with `VITE_E2E=true` or `?e2e=1`. API is `window.__DEFENSEGAME_E2E__` (`src/e2e/e2eGlobal.ts`; `installE2E.ts` entry, `installE2EApi.ts` API object, `installE2EDom.ts` DOM mirrors).
- Scene helpers live in `DefenseSceneE2E.ts` (barrel over `DefenseSceneE2E{Types,Combat,Obstacles,Hud}.ts`) and TownScene `e2e*` wrappers. Specs call the API or DOM mirrors, not Phaser internals.
- CI Chromium is the merge gate. `@manual` suites are skipped in CI.
- `e2e/` and `playwright.config.ts` are typechecked by `npm run typecheck`.
- Run `npm run build:e2e` before Playwright. Visual proof uses `scripts/capture-*.mjs` (see docs/MANUAL_UI_CAPTURE.md).
